# The rotation fold's cubins that have mined on a card with every hit verified, one line for each:
#   <toolkit release> <hash>
# The hash is the cubin's sha256 with its string table zeroed (python probes/hand89/asm89.py hash <cubin>).
# probes/hand89/build_rot.py refuses to write pearl_rot_sm89.cubin unless what it built is listed here for the
# toolkit that built it. The loop in that file is written by hand, so a new line is added only after the file
# it names has run on an RTX 40 card: probes/verify-hits.js 400 of 400 with the fold on, and shares accepted.

# CUDA 12.6 (rig01's local toolkit). rig01, RTX 4090, 11 November 2026: verify-hits 400 of 400 three times,
# Kryptex 24 shares accepted and none rejected.
12.6 15817a7be9c5afdd443cc0aa52b1e14c8299b55d3ac350dacb63f3968a8e388e

# CUDA 12.8 (what CI builds with, Linux and Windows: the same file apart from its string table). The same code
# as 12.6's, byte for byte; one byte of each .nv.info section differs, the toolkit's version. rig01, RTX 4090,
# 11 November 2026, the file native core run 43105008459 built: verify-hits 400 of 400, and 33 shares accepted
# and none rejected by the stand-in pool.
